[00:00.000]...
[00:14.290]She lost her brother a month ago
{"她一个月前失去了哥哥"}
[00:19.888]His picture on the wall
{"墙上仍挂着他的照片"}
[00:22.730]And it reminds me
{"这让我想起"}
[00:27.258]When she brings me coffee, her smile
{"当她端着咖啡对我微笑时"}
[00:32.731]I wish I could be with her 'til my last day
{"多希望余生都能伴她左右"}
[00:40.450]She said she gave all her love to me
{"她说已将全部的爱给了我"}
[00:46.270]We dreamt a new life
{"我们曾憧憬新生活"}
[00:49.020]Some place to be at peace
{"某个安宁的栖身之所"}
[00:53.580]But things changed, suddenly
{"但一切突然变了样"}
[00:58.669]I lost my dreams in this disaster
{"在这场灾难中我梦想尽失"}
[01:05.950]I'm crying
{"我哭泣着"}
[01:08.060]Missing my lover
{"思念着我的爱人"}
[01:11.320]I don't have the power
{"我已无能为力"}
[01:15.320]On my side forever
{"永远站在我这边吧"}
[01:19.440]Oh, where is my lover?
{"我的爱人如今在何方"}
[01:24.310]And I got no power
{"我束手无策"}
[01:29.370]I'm standing alone, no way
{"独自伫立 无路可退"}
[01:36.820]Calling out your name
{"呼唤着你的名字"}
[01:41.530]...
[01:59.430]I said I gave all my love to you
{"我说过把全部爱都给了你"}
[02:05.130]We dreamt a new house
{"我们曾构想新家"}
[02:08.080]Some place to be at peace
{"某个安宁的栖身之所"}
[02:12.650]But things changed, suddenly
{"但一切突然变了样"}
[02:17.790]I lost my dreams in this disaster
{"在这场灾难中我梦想尽失"}
[02:24.309]We don't know what is wrong tonight
{"今夜我们不知问题何在"}
[02:30.979]Everybody's got no place to hide
{"所有人都无处躲藏"}
[02:37.599]No one's left and there's no one to go on
{"无人留下　也无人继续前行"}
[02:44.060]All I know is my life is gone
{"我只知道　我的生命已逝"}
[02:49.940]...
[03:04.080]I'm crying
{"我在哭泣"}
[03:05.900]Missing my lover
{"思念我的爱人"}
[03:09.230]I don't have the power
{"我已无力回天"}
[03:13.270]On my side forever
{"永远站在我这边"}
[03:17.360]Oh, where is my lover?
{"哦　我的爱人在何方？"}
[03:22.640]And I got no power
{"而我已无能为力"}
[03:27.690]I'm standing alone, no way
{"我独自伫立　无路可走"}
[03:34.799]Calling out your name
{"呼唤着你的名字"}
